       <h1>Chris Colfer Discusses Glee Reboot Return</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Actor Chris Colfer revealed on The Daily Beast’s “Obsessed: The Podcast” that he is actively discussing a potential return as Kurt Hummel in the upcoming “Glee” reboot. The project is currently in development at Disney+ and Hulu, with news of the revival first surfacing in late October.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-12/chris-colfer-discusses-glee-reboot-return.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Colfer expressed optimism regarding the concept, noting he has heard the creative direction sounds “very funny and like a good idea.” Original cast member Lea Michele is also attached to the revival, which continues to move through development stages as production conversations proceed with former stars.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief is accurate and captures the core details from the provided source text.</p>
