     <article class="story single" data-beat="sports">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">SPORTS</span> · BBC Sport · 2026-11-12 · editor 7/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>SFA in negotiations for biennial football friendly in Boston</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#sports</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Scottish Football Association (SFA) is in active discussions with Massachusetts state senators regarding a potential biennial friendly match in Boston. The proposal seeks to leverage the strong cultural and economic bonds formed during the summer World Cup, when approximately 25,000 Scotland fans visited the region.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-12/sfa-in-negotiations-for-biennial-football-friendly-in-boston.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>While the specific teams for the fixture remain undecided, the Massachusetts Senate has voted to support the concept of an invitational tournament. Beyond the sporting aspect, the SFA is concurrently negotiating with local businesses regarding investment in the Scottish game to foster continued tourism and economic development between the two regions.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article claims the SFA is negotiating with businesses for investment in the Scottish game, but the source says these are 'advanced negotiations' specifically regarding investment in the Scottish game; the brief is slightly vague but acceptable, however, it misses that the tournament idea is specifically an 'invitational tournament' rather than just a friendly.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqdr1jd5mpp5o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" rel="noopener">BBC Sport</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-11-12/sfa-in-negotiations-for-biennial-football-friendly-in-boston" data-title="SFA in negotiations for biennial football friendly in Boston"><b>Share:</b>
