      <ul><li><a href="https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2026/nov/12/greta-thunberg-cop31-climate-summit" rel="noopener">Guardian Environment</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
